      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The word aswang actually refers to a range of mythological monsters from
    were-dogs, to vampires, to a gruesome \u201Cviscera sucker.\u201D All can change
    their appearance at will, however \u2014 and all hunger for human flesh and blood.
    At night, it is rumored to prowl villages, using deceptive sounds to confuse
    its prey. \n\nWith its backward feet and bloodshot eyes, the aswang\u2019s unsettling
    appearance is as terrifying as its hunger for human flesh.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 33f75d3254c723f4c9f5fe64eeb9ec5c, type: 2}
